## Technical Architecture

### Hybrid Approach
- Database: Dynamic business values that can grow (facility types, locations)
- JSON files: Static UI labels tied to code features (buttons, messages)
- Database enums: System constants (booking_status, org_role)

### Performance
- React Query caching (30 minutes)
- Automatic language detection
- Fallback to JSON translations if database unavailable
- No performance impact on initial render

